Package: tanner
Type: Package
Title: Puberty Stage Line Diagrams and SDS for Tanner Pubertal Stages
Version: 1.8.0
Date: 2026-07-18
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stef", "van Buuren", , "stef.vanbuuren@tno.nl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jeroen", "Ooms", role = "aut"))
Description: Plots Tanner pubertal stage measurements (genital, pubic hair,
    testicular volume, breast, menarche) against Dutch 1997 growth-study
    references as stage line diagrams, and converts observed stages to
    age-conditional standard deviation scores (SDS). Testicular volume can
    be entered as a raw orchidometer reading in ml. Implements the method
    of van Buuren and Ooms (2009) <doi:10.1002/sim.3567>.
